  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Post-Earthquake Reconstruction in Nepal - Building Back Better</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establish partnerships with local &amp; central government, communities and businesses to support the (i) districts effected by the Earthquake to &#x201C;build back better&#x201D; including leading to more resilient (including climate resilient) infrastructure and institutions; (ii) the most vulnerable recover their livelihoods and assets; and (iii) the Government of Nepal to plan for and manage the response to the earthquake.</narrative>
  </description>
